{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"42000000845","bookName":"La mujer destinada para mí","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000004303/42000004303.jpg@w=360&h=640","viewCount":1007690,"followCount":24171,"introduction":"Tras ser abandonado cruelmente, Troya, un artista de buen corazón, contrae matrimonio impulsivamente con una mujer misteriosa llamada Gabriela. Mientras su ex prometida manipuladora y su poderosa familia intentan humillarlo y recuperarlo, Troya descubre que Gabriela es la misma niña a la que salvó en su infancia… y una heredera poderosa. Al elegir su autoestima y el amor verdadero, Troya finalmente se libera de la traición para reclamar el futuro que merece.","chapterCount":56,"labels":["Modern","Childhood Sweetheart"],"tags":["Modern","Childhood Sweetheart"],"typeTwoIds":[304],"typeTwoNames":["Venganza"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":304,"name":"Venganza","replaceName":"venganza"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Venganza","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"The-One-I-was-Meant-to-Marry","bookNameLower":"the-one-i-was-meant-to-marry","shelfTime":"2026-01-21 00:00:00","firstShelfTime":"2026-01-21 00:00:00","performerList":[{"performerId":"12248","performerName":"Zachary Rist","performerFormatName":"Zachary-Rist","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/8x4/12248/12248.jpg?time=1768910658691","videoCount":1},{"performerId":"12039","performerName":"Sophia Delucchi","performerFormatName":"Sophia-Delucchi","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/9x3/12039/12039.jpg?time=1787714625229","videoCount":2}],"performerIdList":[12039,12248]},"chapterList":[{"id":"700059814","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.com/68/3x0/30x3/303x4/30340000024/700275986_1/700275986.720p.narrowv3.mp4?Expires=1795118400&Signature=vkvD5JYtk8~pE1IxKvsnYA6NiCssOYLo7MviGLRZ0-ncRWkG6DdobkyA3qk7kSrRFJy2ymP9q~MuK4~wnOd-7Obh-AKCGyEXUqgNkNK1TntoXcKEOsOR2Ef7dakI6i8Ge78TMg87TpafrS~MUu2yvXf